msgstr "Escolha as contas do Instagram"

#: apps/social_accounts/catalog.py:89
msgid ""
"We list the accounts that login reaches, and you pick which ones to connect."
msgstr ""
"Mostramos as contas que esse login alcança, e você escolhe quais conectar."

#: apps/social_accounts/catalog.py:93
