"The Instagram account has to be professional (Business or Creator) and "
"linked to a Facebook Page. Personal accounts cannot be connected: switch the "
"account type in the Instagram app first."
msgstr ""
"A conta do Instagram precisa ser profissional (Comercial ou Criador de "
